sdiv11: x / 11, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-17, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-17 to where the program needs x / 11, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 11 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 8 cells. It runs 8 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-17: 909x / 10^4 by signed digits: 9x / 100, then -x, then +x, a shift after each
 11     410      SFT 10
 12     790      SUB 90
 13     402      SFT 02
 14     790      SUB 90
 15     401      SFT 01
 16     290      ADD 90
 17     401      SFT 01
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
